---
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';
---

<PageShell title="Teaching">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      My teaching philosophy is grounded in the belief that asynchronous learning should be intentional,
      guided, and active. I prioritize meaningful learning over busywork, providing students with clear
      structure and support while allowing them the independence and flexibility of online learning. I
      design learning experiences that move beyond memorization by asking students to apply biological
      concepts, engage in authentic activities, and demonstrate their understanding in meaningful ways. I
      also recognize the growing role of AI in education and aim to help students develop responsible AI
      literacy and scientific judgment. Ultimately, I view teaching as an ongoing process of design,
      implementation, reflection, and revision, using student feedback, performance, and my own
      observations to continually improve the learning experience.
    </p>

    <p class="process-flow">Design → Teach → Gather Evidence → Reflect → Revise</p>
  </div>

  <nav class="section-links" aria-label="Teaching sections">
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/teaching/reflection-on-course-preparation/')}>
      Reflection on Course Preparation
    </a>
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/teaching/reflection-on-course-implementation/')}>
      Reflection on Course Implementation
    </a>
    <a class="section-link" href={withBase('/teaching/reflection-on-assessment-of-student-performance/')}>
      Reflection on Assessment of Student Performance
    </a>
  </nav>
</PageShell>
